 "sentences": [
  "Our solar system has a protective bubble.",
  "This heliosphere shields Earth from interstellar space.",
  "Computer models show our Sun hit cold gas clouds 3 times.",
  "These clouds shrank the bubble, leaving Earth exposed.",
  "Those interactions triggered major climate shifts on our planet.",
  "Even 3 billion years ago, a dimmer Sun kept early Earth warm.",
  "The Sun's history actively shaped our world."
